Inclusion Criteria: - Invasive mammary cancer or DCIS - Age ≥ 50 years and postmenopausal - Tumor size ≤ 1.5 cm - ER or PR positive - HER2/neu negative - Unicentric tumor - Axillary lymph nodes negative - Negative surgical margins Exclusion Criteria: - Invasive lobular cancer - ER and PR negative tumor with clinical size > 1 cm - HER2+ breast cancer - Known BRCA1 or BRCA2 mutation - Multicentric breast cancer - Positive axillary lymph nodes - Prior breast cancer - Prior breast radiation therapy
